  "absolute_rules": [
    "No recovered title creates a current legal policy by itself.",
    "No missing historical body is reconstructed as a verbatim original from inference.",
    "Token, DAO, crypto, equity, investment, patent, franchise and smart-contract language remains historical/research/legal-review unless separately adopted and current.",
